# 🍷 Wine Quality Prediction using Machine Learning and Streamlit

Prepared for UMBC Data Science Master Degree Capstone  
Instructor: Dr. Chaojie (Jay) Wang  
Author: Akshay Kumar Nagabandi  

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project predicts whether a red wine sample is **Good Quality** or **Not Good Quality** using machine learning and physicochemical properties of wine.

The quality score was converted into binary classification:

- Quality ≥ 7 → Good Quality  
- Quality < 7 → Not Good Quality  

The final model selected was **Random Forest**, based on its higher performance compared to other models.

---

