---

## 🚀 Run Project

Install requirements:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run Streamlit:

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

---

## ⭐ Conclusion

This project demonstrates how machine learning can effectively predict wine quality using chemical properties and provides an interactive application for real-time prediction.
